849	+| Split self-contained deltas | 1, a narrow form | If two or more names arrive under `""` and no nameless delta carries arguments, make one item per name. | **Rejected.** It does not guess, but it makes two or more items with the same `call_id: ""`. Downstream code matches on `call_id`: `loop_state.rs:445` (`deferred.iter().any(\|p\| p.call_id() == c.call_id)`) marks both calls pending when only one is deferred, `resume_exec.rs:176` resolves to the first match, and the provider request translators pair each tool result to its call by id. Two items with one id break all three. |
